# {{lb|en|pharmaceutical drug}} An [[antibiotic]] produced by the ''[[Streptomyces]]'' [[bacterium]].
# {{lb|en|pharmaceutical drug}} Any antibiotic with the same general [[structure]] derived from [[tetracene]] with many [[hydroxyl]] and other groups.

